<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Peoples Heritage raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Peoples Heritage raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said it upgraded Peoples Heritage Financial Group Inc to buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Said company is cheap relative to peers.</p>
<p>-- Cited potential for share buybacks as immediate impetus for upgrade. Also noted industry-leading operating numbers and likelihood for multiple accretive transactions.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose one to 30-1/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
